        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela nzoomuswenenena kuzoobeteka. Nzoofwambaana kuba kamboni wakutapatila balozi, abasimamambe, abasikukonka cakubeja, abasikunyanzya zyakuvola zyabasimilimo, abasikupenzya banabutema abamucaala, abasikukataazya­ beenzu, aboonse batalemeki ndime, mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.5"
            ]
