        {
          "text": "Kuzwa kumazuba aabasinsiku akusikila lino mwasia imbeta zyangu, teemwazibamba pe. Amuboole kulindime, lino ambebo nzooboola kulindinywe, mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu, Pele mwati, Tuboole buti? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
