          "text": "Mwaamba kuti, Kumanina Leza milimo tacigwasyi pe. Twajana impindu nzi muku bamba imbeta zyakwe amukweenda mbuli basidilwe kubusyu bwa-Jehova wamakamu? ",
          "type": "text",
