        {
          "text": "Mpawo abo ibakali kuyoowa Jehova bakali kwaambaula umwi aumwi kumweenzinyina, nkabela Jehova wakaswiilila, wakamvwa, nkabela ibbuku lyakwiibalusya lyakalembwa kulinguwe nkaambo kabaabo ibakali kuyoowa Jehova akuyeeya izina lyakwe, ",
